inforcing a sense of openness, distance, and finality.\n\nThe scene is rendered in a detailed, hand-painted illustration style with soft brush strokes, muted colors, and warm lighting typical of 1940s–1950s magazine illustration. The mood is calm, reflective, and resolved, emphasizing departure, closure, and the quiet aftermath of creative work rather than action.\n\nStyle & Medium Prompt (unchanged)\n\nvintage American illustration, mid-century realism, magazine cover art, narrative illustration, oil paint texture, soft natural lighting, muted warm color palette, fine brushwork, realistic proportions, hand-painted look, classic editorial art\n\nFULL Negative Prompt\n\nmodern digital art, anime, cartoon, CGI, 3D render, glossy lighting, neon colors, surrealism, abstract shapes, distorted anatomy, extra limbs, exaggerated sexuality, erotic pose, pornographic framing, text overlays, watermarks, modern clothing, futuristic elements, mirror attached to easel, mirror on easel, reflective canvas, mirror integrated into canvas, painting action, mid-stroke pose, holding brush, holding palette, facing the painting, walking toward easel, back turned to viewer"]},{"id":28,"type":"UNETLoader","pos":[110,200],"size":[270,82],"flags":{},"order":3,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"unet_name","name":"unet_name","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"unet_name"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"weight_dtype","name":"weight_dtype","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"weight_dtype"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"MODEL","name":"MODEL","type":"MODEL","links":[26]}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.3.73","Node name for S&R":"UNETLoader","models":[{"name":"z_image_turbo_bf16.safetensors","url":"https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/z_image_turbo/resolve/main/split_files/diffusion_models/z_image_turbo_bf16.safetensors","directory":"diffusion_models"}],"enableTabs":false,"tabWidth":65,"tabXOffset":10,"hasSecondTab":false,"secondTabText":"Send Back","secondTabOffset":80,"second